## 3. R4 dense v5：三例拆分运行

```powershell
$root = "E:\Cuexis-worktree\out\review\stage-07-rr\T-01\legacy-corpus-external\replay-current"
$exe  = "$root\compiler\compiler.exe"
$pkg  = "C:\Users\Zilch\Desktop\Cuexis-R4-P7-O2-2026-11-14\keyboard-dense-v5"
foreach ($c in "all-hit", "no-input", "early-hold-release") {
